{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:121e0477e9e7518bd81297dda22d87acd0eddcaa7b3983cb575f847b9e0e6467",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c26f6b3ac1fbe22ded38c30b51cbbfb9a39c8cf5fc6f50412b075df098b45d51",
      "text": "开始之前的、开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2577f9661ae97874d87bf64e3bd5b12011f90040a01acdfedf3f979481d1d2de",
      "text": "因为和朋友打赌，冬马半开玩笑地参加了\n“新人歌手大赛”。\n冬马漂亮地赢得了冠军，成为961 Production的新人偶像。\n随后，冬马在黑井社长的命令下前往某处，\n而在那里等待着他的是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c26f6b3ac1fbe22ded38c30b51cbbfb9a39c8cf5fc6f50412b075df098b45d51",
      "text": "开始之前的、开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aff83071ced60f9f23ae68b934e5f07628f45f1c7188cb52a1a04d7aab956e5",
      "text": "新人歌手大赛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deb6fe25b0df0b1b61431d1469fb1401906387c2ffc95c12e825d959306b2f02",
      "text": "冬马你唱歌那么好，去参加试试看嘛。\n反正你既没参加社团也没打工，挺闲的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc965ba5b3013fa33748e0882ce1ddea6b7390f73b0c1055b59e59e94b7b2a02",
      "text": "虽说确实很闲，\n但突然叫我参加什么比赛也太……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fd1af448c4987aa1695ea49d6f4adc21486a774f8f9fdd77cdfbe0528e314ed",
      "text": "要是拿到优胜，就能从那个“961 Production”\n在演艺圈出道了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1aacfb35d4f9c320a5680234984d58d2dbeecd1ef205435b30b3d7cba41842",
      "text": "961 Pro，就是那个很有名的演艺事务所？\n唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac252679fc37003640747e23dab7ec5e08033ebb284e0f287e7f4abd54eb0c36",
      "text": "算了。\n我又没特别想当什么艺人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8698282ebbaf4492964a65d04e9b8f7ab6dc9896dd234e47cf5bd060c186ceb9",
      "text": "搞什么嘛，你没自信吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5173c13f51307490b1d935ad580a131f03b6757c887f3f191a59ff7609bd1f44",
      "text": "怎么可能。\n你以为我是谁啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:992071de47145341f19dfa976730c697e33ce24e0de76b0d752a7c94b00a0b9b",
      "text": "唱歌好听又帅气的同班同学！\n要是你的话，我真觉得能通过呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20798425b8960c4084914f9ac24905fee562c8b6fc6a79e6e8859424f59f0c31",
      "text": "拜托了，去参加试试看嘛。要是拿了优胜，\n我就给你买展会限定发售的塑料模型。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cddb448e8137370d7b6727b1d1cd3c097873a58e495df287f79b353a4f69144a",
      "text": "真的吗！？……成交。\n我绝对会拿到优胜的，你给我做好觉悟吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d592b78495ad3c7532cbcee3bcd03ade49115ec8bc1921128fe8582965c3eec",
      "text": "看着吧。这种比赛，小菜一碟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dc19bc6d7a0a408abe30584fd9cb967301d06cd8bd6bfdb6e446bea3249290f",
      "text": "……喂？\n啊。歌手大赛，我拿到优胜了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15189721857ba026110fdbf1b50f94fe370423d6e1f56a2b152927f340ff1bca",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我早就说过了吧？\n绝对会拿到优胜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:723c9a85076f1ae61537173ea017845d8376b51ee7b112729a87ad8855473355",
      "text": "喂，你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a928b3f06227cd858d04a731aa784571751422ec8410ff06834569a76aa591ac",
      "text": "嗯？我……吗？\n……抱歉，回学校再说。先挂了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5a43fa93742856196387931e989f92f58205c1309ea7fa92f3abbcf097bf7eb",
      "text": "是叫天濑冬马……对吧，恭喜获得优胜。\n刚才的比赛，表现得非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1cb80cafe32741bda3b0be0c909c7bcbe25fee925e95677096c9d311380fb4",
      "text": "非常感谢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b13aac67229f5c5a90cb5e946d6d02a57a56f013d81c5bb1e2e12ba76b9943c",
      "text": "不过，你谁啊？\n刚才在比赛会场里吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf248fbbdee0bf24ec05991fb492c5c1c22871c4d1184b371a07e1e917dc4e0",
      "text": "因为有点事情，我是在另一个房间看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b273cd7fde3591d3d4407771ae0b111f24a9fc0a74009e1cba8199cc92074571",
      "text": "我是主办本次比赛的\n961 Production社长，黑井崇男。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d",
      "text": "……诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93a3df2c257fbee649d2d914caf188447b3173c1f6011d9aa8dd36d9702ae06b",
      "text": "（这个怎么看都很可疑的大叔，\n竟然是961 Pro的社长……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13d793536d0bc1a813b9b171757bbd565cb8bffd7fe06173e2d4965c1af0af10",
      "text": "迄今为止，有过演艺活动的经验吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eadfd3add74cddce90a7b26d1af626991fe005aba46bd70d1306885db8d7712",
      "text": "就像履历书上写的那样，完全没有。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97e2d5a43988bcbfe277aa66b44383e86b9bd3cf75b5c725d50408bb042e7a95",
      "text": "以前既没有什么明确的目标，\n也没参加过社团……就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33001ec7b44bd80032c69163f0f84fc00db9088773cf8587a83d30fa934daf36",
      "text": "呵呵呵……原来如此……真是不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1f0caf59a3f967eed22d86d62c07b4b9d7acbf4b7bfee308eb902f5778f4be",
      "text": "事不宜迟，天濑冬马。我要让你，\n从我们961 Production出道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ce4c36dd955270cd29cfdacf17eb9db39f6a1f96e020c3c55163d352dfda639",
      "text": "明天开始进行严密细致的课程训练。\n我会狠狠操练你的，做好心理准备吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6da5e70e753402630c5194fd90bedd8df77b8b6652491c4de57dcd92204812c",
      "text": "啊——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59e7ecc2976182213634d6eeef514054451eee6130924b9f4a656ea1b31a4ab",
      "text": "（说起来，好像确实说过要是优胜了\n就能出道来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2030ff72614589c157e06989aa9be73041dcec23cdabbbce50f18ee4567484d",
      "text": "不好意思，我对这种事没兴趣。\n这次会参加，也差不多只是一时兴起而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3d4757d310eda289843080c344691d3d710c92097ae0d9d8c15122ec5639dc",
      "text": "你，难道仅仅拿了这种比赛的优胜就满足了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d55960ac60b9cbaa9513092ab0fd03840e62b540f9cc9bc6f4ee581639762ac",
      "text": "从刚才的模样来看，对于“胜利”这种东西，\n你不是也感受到了相当程度的喜悦吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "那个是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c83359bc35addda3d4b634b207cd144c07f9dcd64981c6912c64c3f10639a64",
      "text": "（……在比赛拿到优胜的时候，\n内心深处确实涌上了一股狂热）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:613d8e4856c826ab41572e0b7b43180e00d8edac242a332f33972441cd7dd086",
      "text": "（那种感觉还是第一次体会到……\n到现在那股热血还在胸口翻腾）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67a3e232c382934a5f3e516aae13ce65bb79b503cc258f55081a5327290918f4",
      "text": "听好了。从今往后，\n你将成为让所有人都俯首称臣的偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95476a893789a6a1a55084f819d6702e3c250a2fc1e3c07ea631497d9ba9f3de",
      "text": "在我的麾下，我要将你培养成顶尖偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09bdf3bdd9667678edb19fb29f763e1854c344220c6c4b9d9c9d4fadf50b9211",
      "text": "顶尖偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bce601c5bee4f6c25e76ea14f6456231d5a627ebf00b0d5d9ad27476769226fd",
      "text": "（和对手竞争，不断胜出。\n那时候的那种热血沸腾的感受……我还想体会更多！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e832be0120825c866b9be77733c147453338ce99175666973891af717716ea",
      "text": "好啊，我干了。\n我绝对要成为顶尖偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b969cc2748df2d70cd53225e02ef0aa9de69ad895336dff0bd9657604ba2e2ab",
      "text": "很好！明天，到这张便条上写着的\n演播室来吧……那么，Adieu！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36ffcca4795881890fd3075c4a3c6fb15b4a1192e5d96515c661f7e5d06c2828",
      "text": "冬马，昨天恭喜你啦！\n真的拿了优胜，太厉害了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5859d307d6df00fc7f21449b7714c4419d5fb3e139a717760d8f0958dc0263f",
      "text": "噢，看到了吧！正如我宣言的那样拿了优胜。\n你也别忘了约定哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef3ff2afa1dca14dac4469ce5d431dd578be019a4cc6800dc4a6c9465fd0259",
      "text": "塑料模型对吧？我记着呢。\n作为优胜庆祝，等下先出去玩吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b703f3e65d57620ca113552db75b12427145b54d69b6402492843dd34b3d8fb6",
      "text": "啊——，抱歉。\n今天稍微有点事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd97766d67ea0c4e1ef66e56118d44d84b9849f2e8bb9a7b275c9613170c82d1",
      "text": "啊！难道说马上就要去进行演艺界的工作了？\n冬马，干劲十足嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2ad3fb9b2a49946055ed6c32cfc70d8d0b9353ff327ca8cb3b6d7305c7ca395",
      "text": "才不是那样呢。\n总之，庆祝优胜等下次吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f9dceee82da1aebe56a8681b5e8d2c6f6f1aa99014bb4855346a425d649888",
      "text": "这里就是大叔指定的演播室吗。\n话说回来，这到底是什么演播室啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab5612f82bc946f0a4f58cd449b358752af796cdd12e5d186e92d11c0e16a7ec",
      "text": "便条上只写了地点而已。\n……总之先进去看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f49bf9d6db0409338460c96d0399f55541b10e3cbf6674020955a59994762b59",
      "text": "这里是……摄影棚？\n为什么会在这种地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f3f1ec06cd1799786112dc1df3a0352e5f659c4bba9631b5e43482627eff7c9",
      "text": "哎呀？你是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1712cef09611ef1bfe4a8a6d79ff384e41fb2634852a8036cce7188712ed7f64",
      "text": "难不成小哥也是被黑酱叫过来的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a4f4c3a5917c9d5b406b818a61b36e962063be3f3769ebc58dfbed479aedbb8",
      "text": "（什么啊，这几个人……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:728488f50fc92fc1211c2a52fea2ae0c41246232fab501353dabf274be0e2ec3",
      "text": "黑酱是谁啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2994321c1624051beca71fab9970690e5d3a66d056cedcc98247e6a03ff7646",
      "text": "是指黑井社长哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cbf71d2eaf61610d9837c5fa520c9570903bfe90a63f8571e6ac9bc92c5fb96",
      "text": "我是伊集院北斗。直到最近为止都在当模特，\n后来被黑井社长发掘来当偶像了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d15c9b34ed6730763327255ebc55cd964ad9aefac6222c58d17870c8a62757",
      "text": "请多关照咯☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2704edf4257bcd374b746b83a3a14e63a8ce015afe762d35feff5aaa1a0de096",
      "text": "啊、啊啊。你好。\n我是天濑冬马。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c50ef278b0121419e603016eb883a4ba5e6bcbd572f69ff395f0b1791827739",
      "text": "昨天在歌手大赛拿到优胜的时候，\n被那个大叔……被黑井社长搭话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:795613ca450dc0d6b1e4c5e93e2e0e3f60d8b40efa77ad5f8380d0a3852e2180",
      "text": "哎——！在比赛里拿了优胜吗？\n小哥好厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ef8a73bb6c416c5f0264da90c6ec3defb94192473e5d36895495bcc7ab24fa6",
      "text": "不愧是大事务所961 Pro主办的比赛呢，\n听说竞争率相当高哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55dc94fd7826724bb1434e55547ca6c79fae1e7d6af56ef110fb2dcc61afbdff",
      "text": "能在那里拿到优胜，\n说明是个相当有实力的人……吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4777a15814acd27ca6b17a06ecac769204bdace058117b09b2590b04fe0d4fe4",
      "text": "嗯——。那么说来，你唱歌很厉害咯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7b95289b13de5da129fe361c151c93f81642ab158466cebfa871247a8dd58fb",
      "text": "还好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d651922f2cf3f235710e659d4decd68729a10238f353e2cf1f92199df0ffd7f4",
      "text": "嘿——……不过，要是跳舞的话，\n肯定是我更厉害哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5",
      "text": "啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fed2c820e802bec6eb52a6e27df9f44a69b0e94e631b8477dfe5a9009dd8e988",
      "text": "啊哈哈，我是御手洗翔太。\n那个……冬马君、北斗君。请多指教啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fa22902a81855efeb0140c831b50cc39bba1c6176c0bd17f48f841f497c1acf",
      "text": "啊啊，请多指教……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77bc7c1c8853c13c36cce60d6dbfa282b80b1e2111039ff9a89af787ab0d235f",
      "text": "哼，都到齐了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c082314007837132c77e05f00013d30f4b5ff702505792f8f62aeed54a5769",
      "text": "大……黑井社长！\n把我们叫到这种地方来，到底要干什么啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f375d1ce5801bfb3a5147c297be92a2cc64666db9da9d6dbb991063b33fc4d5",
      "text": "把你们召集起来没有别的原因。\n天濑冬马、御手洗翔太、伊集院北斗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:438cc758ed45bf854ef46c0004948f18980d0b87e62fdeb72f573ba81a8606af",
      "text": "我现在就要让你们组成“Jupiter”\n出道，并君临偶像界的顶峰！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9aecbc1aa9d75278e30c5a1849ad2c5980c5badf5d1ef5900cb7292ab227219",
      "text": "拍摄开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0019c96ac5b774eb37489c261105cc063d3409cf8d27a207d6e8358dac4630e6",
      "text": "拍摄，请多关照！\n……诶？要笑一笑……是、这种感觉吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65bbdf3b22f6e45a8c18784538aa1e9fed49916bb2ef50617e751656fe3c520",
      "text": "唔——，表情可能有点僵硬。\n希望能笑得更自然一点哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f558e9709cb960f5eff5e78f685b74ed4c2af9c9754063af4acf7b430cb472e",
      "text": "自然的笑容？……这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a7cab97a977dc4f23926ee75a1fa59e5f963874317d3a6db6285f74cd00e2f",
      "text": "（可恶，脸都抽筋了！话说回来，奇怪？\n我平时到底是怎么笑来着……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42113d9e952be1946d868d6f92351a81d82557b124e0b94dbffc7e59e59e60f4",
      "text": "啊哈哈！冬马君未免也\n太僵硬了吧，简直像个机器人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f5eab7d8845fad236ccc946bb03d268eac6eb90333b37f964c50ca463135731",
      "text": "虽然自称唱歌很厉害，但宣传照？\n面对这种拍摄似乎还完全不行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f763bdb711e3c2104fd0129daf421c4f3f23aed766bc10de41bc7dd6f78265",
      "text": "呵呵，那种青涩的地方，\n不也很符合新人偶像的风格嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8408ecefb97daab8c94376da912ed5a1eb7c7354f5e31ab82e657ab51330cc7a",
      "text": "总算结束了……\n光是拍个照片，就要消耗这么多体力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4c615b931bfbb4d7b013daaa94b870e8e84c6fa45aa7fe089d4073b9bfb6fe5",
      "text": "辛苦了，冬马。\n最后那部分表现得相当不错哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd7e0867b1429b2e40dd49c296c52477cd7b89217ccf4ed766a540392d9a84a0",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那是当然的啦！\n那么，接下来轮到谁拍了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91f265742fe78bba46e7a6619d348c9a540a88d842a80eb5fe44d8248e42fb24",
      "text": "好——的，轮到我了呢。\n……嘛，看好了哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48151076f88a54835151428a6bb5d8d2504ea272abace998be2b2b355298921d",
      "text": "呐，摄影师。\n回过头来的动作虽然也不错，但是……哈嘿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac2746e8ec3e3da578ee4e013a95795aacb6051848f799e56253394a6722e57",
      "text": "这种姿势怎么样？动作更明显一些的话，\n我觉得更有我的风格呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9dca199e1863f11f41ebae78d74922668ed3f0a13243a60f78a25d8f67d3ea9",
      "text": "哦哦！非常棒哦，翔太君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e28e61289612ab0982658b2e13ed7985c470fdeb4fabc7b6e646e94273590c63",
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a6eefc2ef9cd3b248cf6de06cf3b7265768e6933775bee6494ac2fd8037b33",
      "text": "翔太虽然也说过是第一次拍这种照片，\n但进展得真顺利呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0ff11c3dfa47c418823fa8ce9cae409b2674d80655629868d4a9588d4cfe43a",
      "text": "怎么说呢，真有活力啊。\n而且转眼间就跟摄影师搞好关系了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fde180b26bc0bc07533584ec4419327a603d361674769703226845b0e177b6",
      "text": "刚才我还看到他\n和其他工作人员聊得很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6b1c8418f235e1acabc3168f527476827c499cbd8c5f9ba1e9c062b2949a14",
      "text": "翔太或许拥有让人喜爱的才能吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65313f8d0f33901c4d55d93b5488bb007afeb8c2a4137f6adaa6240d2764d3b",
      "text": "我回来啦——！呐，怎么样？\n我的拍摄很完美吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aaba778eddc0bf52f48e34ad969a8e8ddf7d88f26200d8ebe97ca59d89f1f28",
      "text": "辛苦了，非常出色哦。\n……那么，接下来轮到我了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f2577806157b85431ab0b99779090df5be0aa50e5f301ec7540d44b35e79b0",
      "text": "好的，我明白了。\n那么接下来……这样的表情，如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55c7816d32ff9a56e201010158aa3a1fbeac264a7eddf565511f6b10bad9f127",
      "text": "啊，OK了吗？\n拍得很漂亮呢，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5262ff55567b3eae7a90e981be34dcc6916c9e619a4aee76f65569079e3b16",
      "text": "哇——，北斗君只是抛了个媚眼，\n工作人员们就骚动起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1472f5d7948be7ac2937034a0dcd0c2399a7d04cc0167e8b605aa87bf9fad61",
      "text": "听他说之前当过模特，看来很清楚\n怎样才能展现出自己最好的一面呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2654e50c8fec3f32185c4b6a22f32dbbd7a109f8adefaca9f0f4244479da1044",
      "text": "是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81dc41d2aab1f2f3831ac78e95e4f639af5e6a1c6735c6ce3d9f59f575dc7e8",
      "text": "（没想到这家伙居然有这种实力……\n我也不能认输！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8d30669d734c10f02010a98cec3bd34fa99fd8fab70801fd1b32e6d58e4be0",
      "text": "我回来了，冬马、翔太。\n最后是三个人的合照，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52b9599f0b525cf09b6d6e6e570b30441db4849d55e95f9b44222157d1962f35",
      "text": "噢！我来大显身手给你们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc5c67cd3c3e7b15d849bb60b2e7557c78eed6f65d347b7e5dc2c084040ac1c3",
      "text": "哎呀？突然很有干劲嘛。\n是看了北斗君的拍摄后，终于被点燃斗志了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576089e2812351a770838cccac41471677085013c0828d5f72c277471f776406",
      "text": "我说了我从一开始就很有干劲啦！\n只是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502d32425c1bce54e97270d3b8632f94cdf876778b04141226a26fa8813987f0",
      "text": "（近距离看着对手的模样……果然很有趣啊。\n这次轮到我让他们大吃一惊了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1cb1f3e9c23f134f30d13bf8d9956eba204f07d9b229d337e9dc8da20fd4fe6",
      "text": "……呵呵。一开始虽然摆出一副冷酷的样子，\n但意外的是个很热血的人呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
